### Create a demo patient
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Demo Patient",
  "monitoringPlan": "Post-discharge daily monitoring"
}

### Start a daily monitoring session (replace patient ID if needed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/patients/1/sessions

### Patient reports dizziness and pain
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/sessions/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transcript": "I feel dizzy today and my pain is 6 out of 10."
}

### Patient answers a follow-up
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitoring/sessions/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transcript": "I did not faint or pass out."
}
